   "source": [
    "# Regression Training \u2014 Elemental Concentration Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "Trains and evaluates all regression models:\n",
    "- **CNNRegressor** and **ResNetRegressor** (PyTorch)\n",
    "- **PLSBaseline** and **RidgeBaseline** (scikit-learn)\n",
    "\n",
    "All models predict the relative concentration of each of the 41 supported elements\n",
    "from a 600-bin XRF spectrum. Targets are Dirichlet-distributed (sum to 1, sparse).\n",
    "\n",
    "Metrics are computed **only on active elements** (ground-truth > 0) to avoid\n",
    "trivial inflation from predicting 0 for absent elements."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
